%S A047684 1,1,2,9,126,13596,108096891
%N A047684 Number of reduced contexts on n unlabeled objects.
%C A047684 Equivalently, the number of non-isomorphic, nonempty, finite lattices with n join-irreducible elements. The sequence A235604, which counts non-isomorphic atomistic lattices with n atoms, provides a lower bound. - _Jakob Süskind_, Sep 28 2026
%D A047684 Bernhard Ganter, Rudolf Wille: Formal Concept Analysis, Springer-Verlag, 1999, ISBN 3-540-62771-5, p. 59.
%Y A047684 Cf. A235604, A006966.
%K A047684 hard,nonn,nice,more,changed
%O A047684 0,3
